cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DiffSim in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "DiffSim: GPU-native differentiable octree-SBM finite elements"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ganapathysubramanian"
    given-names: "Baskar"
    affiliation: "Iowa State University"
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/BaskarGS/diffsim"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Differentiable incompressible-flow finite elements on adaptive
  octrees with the Shifted Boundary Method, GPU-native (NVIDIA Warp),
  supporting neural-SDF (INR) geometry with exact adjoint gradients
  for shape and constitutive parameters.
